  "interpretation": "Each physical fit is counted once; aliases do not add cost. These are sums of per-worker elapsed timers under shared GPUs, not GPU-device hours, energy, or controlled speed comparisons. BAN measured epochs sum training plus validation/scoring/checkpoint time; TAPB measured epoch time also includes validation/scoring/checkpoint writing. Startup, final inference, asset downloads, dictionary preparation, and historical research are not included in these fit timers. The development encoder timer starts after model loading; test encoding is separate. No new training, inference, or selection is performed by this cost calculation.",
