  "calculation": "For all21 manifest jobs use the final queue verification directory and require summary SHA equality; for all5 TAPB seeds require complete summary. Require exactly epochs1..100 and correct seed. Sum epoch.train_seconds and require exact resources.training_seconds equality. BAN epoch time is sum(train_seconds+validation_seconds); TAPB uses sum(epoch_seconds), both checked against resource totals. Divide sums by3600 for worker hours; count each unique fit once. Fixed update totals use783*100 per BAN fit and ceil(50149/60)*100 per TAPB fit."
